msgstr "Det startet ikke"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1084
msgid "Read the partition table"
msgstr "Les partisjonstabellen"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1085
msgid "Analyze the whole disk"
msgstr "Analyser hele disken"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1086
msgid "It reads all of the disk. On a drive with problems this is extra wear."
msgstr "Det leser hele disken. På en disk med problemer gir det ekstra slitasje."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1089
msgid "This drive reported problems: analyzing all of it is extra wear. A disk image first spares it."
msgstr "Denne disken har rapportert problemer: å analysere hele disken gir ekstra slitasje. Et diskbilde først skåner den."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1111
msgid "Stopping…"
msgstr "Stopper …"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1118
msgid "Volumes this drive already has"
msgstr "Volumer denne disken allerede har"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1119
msgid "They are not lost. To recover their files, copying them is faster and reads the disk less than any analysis."
msgstr "De er ikke tapt. For å gjenopprette filene deres er kopiering raskere og leser disken mindre enn noen analyse."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1124
msgid "Recover its files"
msgstr "Gjenopprett filene"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1136
msgid "Looking for partitions…"
msgstr "Leter etter partisjoner …"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1140
msgid "TestDisk does not say how far it has gone, so there is no percentage. Analyzing a whole disk reads all of it and can take hours; the drive can be used for nothing else meanwhile."
msgstr "TestDisk sier ikke hvor langt det har kommet, så det finnes ingen prosent. En analyse av hele disken leser alt og kan ta timer; disken kan ikke brukes til noe annet i mellomtiden."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1151
#, python-format
msgid "Elapsed: %s"
msgstr "Medgått tid: %s"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1171
msgid "The search failed."
msgstr "Søket mislyktes."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1174
msgid "What TestDisk found"
msgstr "Hva TestDisk fant"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1180
msgid "Big-Mount does not rewrite partition tables, on purpose: a mistake there can lose everything. A disk image, or a search by content, recovers files without that risk."
msgstr "Big-Mount skriver med vilje ikke om partisjonstabeller: en feil der kan føre til at alt går tapt. Et diskbilde, eller et søk etter innhold, gjenoppretter filer uten den risikoen."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1182
msgid "The analysis did not recognize any partition. That does not prove there is no data: a search by content may still find files."
msgstr "Analysen gjenkjente ingen partisjoner. Det beviser ikke at det ikke finnes data: et søk etter innhold kan fortsatt finne filer."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1184
msgid "The partition table is empty or unreadable. Analyzing the whole disk may find what it no longer lists."
msgstr "Partisjonstabellen er tom eller uleselig. En analyse av hele disken kan finne det tabellen ikke lenger viser."

